OL,3,GNEWSA'Essential' revamp at Grade II
OL,4,Alisted library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary library is to open later so
OL,7,Fresidents can continue to access
OL,8,Fservices while major work continues at
OL,9,FLancaster Central Library.
OL,11,FThe work is "essential" to protect the
OL,12,Ffuture of the Grade II listed building,
OL,13,Fwhich was built on Market Square in
OL,14,F1932, Lancashire County Council said.
OL,16,FThe temporary library, at White Cross
OL,17,FBusiness Park on Quarry Road, is in
OL,18,Fwalking distance of the library and
OL,19,Fwill open six days a week.
OL,21,FLancaster Central Library is expected
OL,22,Fto reopen in spring 2027.
